    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. i went into my room and turned everything off but it doesnt work. the noise is still in my head. even when it's dark i still feel like everything is rushing at me and i cant catch my breath. i just feel so exhausted by existing. like i've been running a marathon for years and i'm just done. i just want a silence that actually stays. a real silence.",
